{"id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-oracle-class.md","title":"Oracle Complexity Classes","display":"df-oracle-class — Oracle Complexity Classes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-oracle-class","aliases":["28-df-oracle-class","Oracle Complexity Class"],"display":"df-oracle-class — Oracle Complexity Classes","depends_on":["[[28-df-oracle-tm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-oracle-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-oracle-class</span><span>Oracle Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-class — Oracle Complexity Classes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e7207510b515565\" href=\"?note=3e7207510b515565\" title=\"28-df-oracle-tm\">28-df-oracle-tm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{OTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ONTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{ONTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(O^B)\">\\(L(O^B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e7207510b515565\" href=\"?note=3e7207510b515565\" title=\"28-df-oracle-tm\">28-df-oracle-tm</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf P^B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(O^B)\\mid O\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\land\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NP}^B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(O^B)\\mid O\\in\\mathrm{ONTM}\\land\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf P^B,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf{NP}^B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf P^B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(O^B)\\mid O\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\land\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NP}^B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L(O^B)\\mid O\\in\\mathrm{ONTM}\\land\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf P^B,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf{NP}^B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>类指数在形式上取所有固定语言预言机的并，避免把“复杂度类”直接送入语言查询接口。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 有多项式时间多一完全语言，此并等于查询任一该类完全语言得到的类，因为每次查询都可先归约。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义3.5及§5.5末段；印刷73、103页；PDF99、129页。语言预言机与类指数记法已区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$\\mathrm{ONTM}$、$L(O^B)$、$\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ONTM}","display":false},{"tex":"L(O^B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf P^B&\\coloneqq\\{L(O^B)\\mid O\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\land\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NP}^B&\\coloneqq\\{L(O^B)\\mid O\\in\\mathrm{ONTM}\\land\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf P^B,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf{NP}^B.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1482,"backlinks":[{"id":"1b55a40958811c5e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathbf P$、$\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}$ 与类预言机指数 $\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-oracle-class]]。"},{"id":"f63fcc28a9b7afe5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"相对化类的已定义实例 $\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；涉及其他类时必须先给出它们的预言机版本。"},{"id":"3d2ecd22e6ac1631","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\mathbf P^B$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"预言机：[[28-df-oracle-tm]]、[[28-df-oracle-c